  "description": "<p>Carry your firearm discreetly and securely with Rothco&rsquo;s Concealed Carry Backwoods Canvas Vest. With 2 interior CCW pockets and 2 interior mag pouches, the concealed carry vest ensures you're always prepared and at the ready. On the outside, the canvas vest includes 2 spacious front pockets with snap closures for your personal essentials, while the 2 large chest pockets offer additional storage space. Made from a comfortable yet durable 100% cotton canvas outer shell and a lightweight diamond quilted polyester liner, the Backwoods Canvas Vest provides exceptional warmth in cold weather climates. The sturdy 2-way zipper closure offers quick access to your CCW gear, and the ribbed collar enhances the outerwear's dimension and style. Made from Rothco&rsquo;s durable heavyweight canvas fabric, this superior material is naturally water-resistant, rugged, and is built for the long haul. No one comes close to Rothco&rsquo;s collection of ultra-premium canvas bags, packs, and apparel.</p>",
